      "paths": [
        "/dashboard",
        "/dashboard/*"
      ],
      "when": "every engine since 1.8 (ENG-413 WP14), with or without an extension and in setup mode: the engine serves no page, TandemApp's controller does. 1.4 to 1.7: a headless engine (ENG-413 WP3a); an extension that served the page answered it",
      "shape": "error.type and error.code no_ui, the message names TandemApp"
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "what": "404 not_on_engine",
      "since": "1.4",
      "paths": [
        "/v1/conductor/*",
        "/v1/library",
        "/v1/library/*",
        "/v1/memory",
        "/v1/memory/*",
        "/v1/laya",
        "/v1/laya/*",
        "/s/{token}/v1/library*",
        "/s/{token}/v1/memory*",
        "/s/{token}/v1/laya*",
        "/v1/config",
        "/v1/config/*",
        "/v1/collect/*"
      ],
      "when": "nothing in the engine's process serves the path: no extension route for it (the conductor's, its library and memory); /v1/laya* without the engine's decision models; /v1/config* and /v1/collect/* on every engine since 1.8 (before it: with --backends off). A session address answers as the path under it",
      "shape": "error.type and error.code not_on_engine, the message names TandemApp"
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "what": "404 not_on_engine",
      "since": "1.8",
      "paths": [
        "/v1/chat-app",
        "/v1/chat-app/*"
      ],
      "when": "every engine since 1.8 (ENG-413 WP14): the Chat tab's forward left the engine with the page; TandemApp's controller serves it. A body the request carries is not read",
      "shape": "error.type and error.code not_on_engine, the message names TandemApp"
    }
  ],
